---

<main
  class="bg-white min-h-[90vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 relative"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl text-center relative z-10">
    <h1
      class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tighter mb-8"
    >
      てりたま<span
        class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-400 to-amber-600 p-1"
        >.</span
      >
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-sm md:text-md lg:text-xl text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 font-light tracking-widest opacity-80"
    >
      無駄を削ぎ落とし、体温の通うデジタル体験を。 <br
        class="hidden md:inline"
      />
      私たちは、日常に彩りと驚きを添えるプロダクトを届けています。
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="#products"
        class="px-12 py-5 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors tracking-widest"
      >
        プロダクトを見る
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/teritamas"
        target="_blank"
        class="px-12 py-5 bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-slate-50 hover:border-orange-200 hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors tracking-widest shadow-sm"
      >
        GitHub を見る
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
